1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch6","children":["FOSA丨06丨评估和管理架构特性"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨06丨评估和管理架构特性"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第六章的课后思考题，深入探讨如何衡量和管理架构特性，分析圈复杂度等结构性指标的重要性、架构适应度函数的定义与应用，以及运维性、结构性、流程性指标的评估方法，帮助理解如何建立有效的架构治理机制来持续监控和优化系统架构。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-07T11:00:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/07"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,727"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第六章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why is cyclomatic complexity such an important metric to analyze for architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么圈复杂度是架构分析的重要指标？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is an architecture fitness function? How can they be used to analyze an architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"什么是架构适应度函数？它们如何用于分析架构？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide an example of an architecture fitness function to measure the scalability of an architecture."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"提供一个衡量架构可伸缩性的架构适应度函数示例。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the most important criteria for an architecture characteristic to allow architects and developers to create fitness functions?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"允许架构师和开发人员创建适应度函数的最重要标准是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"评估架构特性","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#评估架构特性","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#评估架构特性"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"评估架构特性","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":4,"offset":727},"end":{"line":23,"column":10,"offset":733}}}]},"children":"评估架构特性"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"评估架构特性一般可以从 3 个方面入手："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"运维性指标 (operational measures)：主要关注系统在运维层面的能力，涵盖性能、可扩展性、弹性、可用性、可靠性等能力。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["结构性指标 (structural measures)：关注代码结构，如模块化、组件间受控的耦合、可读代码以及其他内部质量评估。常用工具有：\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"圈复杂度 (Cyclomatic Complexity，CC)"}],"：一个代码层面的度量标准，由 Thomas McCabe, Sr. 于 1976 年开发，通过分析代码的决策点（如 if 语句）来量化代码的复杂性。高圈复杂度可能表明代码难以理解和测试。公式为 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"CC = E - N + 2"}],"（针对单个函数），或 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"CC = E - N + 2P"}],"（针对扇出调用）。行业普遍认为 CC 值低于 10 是可接受的，但更倾向于低于 5。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"距主序列距离 (Distance from the Main Sequence，D)"}],"：一个基于抽象性（A）和不稳定性（I）的综合指标，公式为 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"D = |A + I - 1|"}],"。它反映了抽象性和不稳定性之间的理想关系。远离理想线的类可能落入\"无用区\"（过于抽象难以使用）或\"痛苦区\"（过于具体且难以维护）"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L8","\n"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13"]}]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16"]}],"$L17"]}]]}]}]
